# UX workflow: inspect a non-flat macro automation curve.
# Purpose: validates that the automation detail overlay renders a compact
# sparkline instead of only textual curve metadata.

0 scenario macro-automation-curve-shape
80 capture screen macro_grid_curve_source

# Open Macro Edit for Macro 1.
180 button MACRO_1 down
1280 tick
1360 capture screen macro_1_edit_detail
1460 button MACRO_1 up

# Open Automation detail.
1620 encoder NAV 1
1780 tap NAV 60
2020 capture screen macro_1_automation_sparkline
